    "classFeature": [
        {
            "name": "Spellcasting",
            "source": "Legzy",
            "page": 1,
            "className": "Spellblade",
            "classSource": "Legzy",
            "level": 1,
            "entries": [
                "You have learned to use the most basic of arcane power. The information below details how you use those rules with Spellblade spells, which appear in the {@filter Spellblade spell list|spells|class=spellblade (Legzy)|source=Legzy}.",
                {
                    "type": "entries",
                    "name": "Spell Slots.",
                    "entries": [
                        "The Spellblade Features table shows how many spell slots you have to cast your level 1+ spells. You regain all expended slots when you finish a {@variantrule Long Rest|Legzy}."
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "entries",
                    "name": "Spells Known of Level 1+.",
                    "entries": [
                        "You know one 1st-level spells of your choice from the {@filter Spellblade spells|spells|class=spellblade (Legzy)|source=Legzy}.",
                        "The Spells Known column of the Spellblade table shows when you learn more spellblade spells of your choice. Each of these spells must be of a level for which you have spell slots. For instance, when you reach 5th level in this class, you can learn one new spell of 1st or 2nd level.",
                        "Additionally, when you gain a level in this class, you can choose one of the spellblade spells you know and replace it with another spell from the spellblade spell list, which also must be of a level for which you have spell slots."
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "entries",
                    "name": "Spellcasting Ability.",
                    "entries": [
                        "Intelligence is your spellcasting ability for your Spellblade spells, since you learn your spells through dedicated study. You use your Intelligence whenever a spell refers to your spellcasting ability. In addition, you use your Intelligence modifier when setting the saving throw DC for a spellblade spell you cast and when making an attack roll with one.",
                        "Spell save DC = 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Intelligence modifier",
                        "Spell attack modifier = your proficiency bonus + your Intelligence modifier"
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "entries",
                    "name": "Spellcasting Focus",
                    "entries": [
                        "You can use a weapon as a Spellcasting Focus for your Spellblade spells."
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "Arcana Points",
            "source": "Legzy",
            "page": 1,
            "className": "Spellblade",
            "classSource": "Legzy",
            "level": 1,
            "entries": [
                "Whenever you cast a spell, you retain a fraction of that spell's power and hold it. When you cast a spell of first level or higher and expend a spell slot, you gain a number of Arcana Points equal to the spell slot you expended. You can hold a number of Arcana Points equal to your {@variantrule Proficiency|Ishiir} bonus, and they last until you complete a {@variantrule Long Rest|Ishiir}.",
                "While you have Arcana Points, you may expend one to perform the following minor magical feats.",
                {
                    "type": "entries",
                    "name": "Quickstep.",
                    "entries": [
                        "As a {@variantrule Bonus Action|Ishiir}, you teleport to an unoccupied space up to 15 feet from your position."
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "entries",
                    "name": "Displacement.",
                    "entries": [
                        "As a {@variantrule Bonus Action|Ishiir}, you create an illusion that blurs your image by a few inches, causing any creature to have {@variantrule Disadvantage|Ishiir} on attack rolls against you until the start of your next turn."
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "entries",
                    "name": "Encumber.",
                    "entries": [
                        "As a {@variantrule Reaction|Ishiir} when a creature is within 30 feet of you, you slow their {@variantrule Speed|Ishiir} by 10 feet."
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
